%% Sequence — Alur End-to-End: Registrasi, Matchmaking, Booking-Escrow, Tour, Settlement & Review
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Wisatawan
    participant S as Sistem
    participant G as Guide
    participant A as Admin
    participant PG as Payment Gateway
    participant B as Bank

    Note over C,S: Fase 1 — Registrasi & Verifikasi
    C->>S: Registrasi akun (/register/customer)
    G->>S: Registrasi guide + unggah KTP, KTPP, SKCK, pas foto, SOP sign-off
    S-->>G: Akun tersimpan (pending_verification)
    S->>A: Notifikasi antrean dokumen legalitas
    A->>S: Verifikasi dokumen (approve)
    S-->>G: Status akun verified / active

    Note over C,S: Fase 2 — Matchmaking & Pre-Booking Chat
    C->>S: Filter guide (spesialisasi, gaya komunikasi, tarif)
    S-->>C: Daftar guide cocok
    C->>S: Kirim pesan chat
    S->>G: Teruskan pesan real-time
    G->>S: Balas pesan + kesepakatan custom itinerary
    S-->>C: Balasan real-time

    Note over C,S: Fase 3 — Booking & Pembayaran Escrow
    C->>S: Ajukan booking + custom itinerary
    S-->>C: Booking dibuat (pending_confirmation)
    S->>G: Notifikasi order baru
    alt Guide menyetujui
        G->>S: Setujui order
        S-->>C: Permintaan pembayaran (waiting_payment)
        C->>S: Instruksi pembayaran
        S->>PG: Request pembayaran QRIS/VA
        PG-->>C: Halaman pembayaran
        C->>PG: Konfirmasi pembayaran
        PG-->>S: Notifikasi status paid
        S->>S: Booking = confirmed, escrow = paid_in_escrow
        S-->>C: Booking terkonfirmasi
        S-->>G: Order confirmed
    else Guide menolak / wisatawan batal
        G->>S: Tolak order
        S-->>C: Booking dibatalkan (cancelled)
    end

    Note over C,S,G: Fase 4 — Pelaksanaan Tour (Live Tracking)
    G->>S: Update status heading_to_location
    S-->>C: Live tracking (stepper)
    G->>S: Start tour (ongoing)
    S-->>C: Status tour aktif
    G->>S: End tour (completed)

    Note over S: Fase 5 — Settlement Otomatis
    S->>S: Split otomatis: 10% komisi platform / 90% net guide
    S->>S: Escrow = released_to_guide, wallet guide +90% net

    Note over G,S,A,B: Fase 6 — Withdrawal (Payout)
    G->>S: Ajukan penarikan dana
    S-->>G: Antrean payout dibuat (pending)
    S->>A: Notifikasi antrean payout
    A->>S: Setujui payout
    S->>B: Instruksi transfer ke rekening guide
    B-->>S: Konfirmasi transfer
    S-->>G: Dana masuk rekening (withdrawal success)

    Note over C,S: Fase 7 — Rating & Ulasan
    C->>S: Kirim rating (1-5) & ulasan
    S-->>C: Ulasan tersimpan di profil guide
